L'Oréal Professionnel|loreal-professionnel|Haircare|Professional salon haircare & treatments (Separate brand)|Professional Shampoo,Conditioner,Hair Masks,Hair Serums,Hair Treatments,All L'Oréal Professionnel Products
Lotus Herbals|lotus-herbals|Skincare|Botanical skincare & sun protection (Not makeup)|Skincare,Face Care,Sunscreen,Cleansers,Moisturisers,All Lotus Herbals Products
